    "tokens": "The ocj_ tokens below were minted by that throwaway in-memory database with a test-only secret. They authenticate nothing on any deployed backend.",
    "sequence": "Captured in one run, in order: the event is open (not blind) for judge_plants_open and judge_scan_open, then set blind; the first plant carries a legacy id-derived tag until owner_reissue_qr_tokens; judge C is assigned only Paphiopedilum; judge A's credential is revoked just before judge_me_revoked_401. owner_issue_without_owner_key_401 is an owner route called with no owner key (what a browser owner session receives on these routes today); owner_issue_unconfigured_503 is issuance with CALYX_JUDGE_TOKEN_SECRET unset.",
    "note": "Every entry is a real backend response (status + body). Any other error shape used in tests is labelled synthetic in that test."
